@20 = ~Bonemelt: Arms~
@21 = ~Bonemelt: Arms

Touch attack. 8d8 acid damage, then save vs. Death at -2 or the target suffers a -4 penalty to THAC0 and damage rolls for 1 hour. On a successful save, a random limb is affected at half strength for 30 minutes.~

